WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.025
Kip fell off the snowball.

2
00:00:06.026 --> 00:00:09.067
He slid across the frozen pond.

3
00:00:09.068 --> 00:00:13.695
Finally he stopped.

4
00:00:13.696 --> 00:00:18.685
Kip sighed. "Bird was right.

5
00:00:18.686 --> 00:00:25.074
I can't play in the snow now.

6
00:00:25.075 --> 00:00:28.944
I'll go back home."

7
00:00:28.945 --> 00:00:31.096
He climbed to his feet.

8
00:00:31.097 --> 00:00:34.071
But then—

9
00:00:34.072 --> 00:00:37.243
whoosh! The ice was very

10
00:00:37.244 --> 00:00:43.118
slippery. Kip fell hard.

11
00:00:43.119 --> 00:00:45.721
Bam! "Ouch!" cried

12
00:00:45.722 --> 00:00:48.757
Kip. Kip got back on his

13
00:00:48.758 --> 00:00:52.509
feet. His feet slipped again!

14
00:00:52.510 --> 00:00:56.155
Bam! "Ouch!" Kip cried

15
00:00:56.156 --> 00:00:58.741
again. Carefully Kip stood up again.

16
00:00:58.742 --> 00:01:03.351
He walked slowly.

17
00:01:03.352 --> 00:01:08.174
He slipped and fell four more times.

18
00:01:08.175 --> 00:01:21.700
Finally Kip was off the frozen pond.

19
00:01:21.701 --> 00:01:29.993
He climbed back up his tree.

20
00:01:29.994 --> 00:01:33.588
He took off his snow gear.

21
00:01:33.589 --> 00:01:54.314
And he got back into bed.

22
00:01:54.315 --> 00:01:56.659
Later that day Bird woke him.

23
00:01:56.660 --> 00:02:00.151
"The blizzard is over, Kip!" said Bird.

24
00:02:00.152 --> 00:02:02.945
"Let's play in the snow!"

25
00:02:02.946 --> 00:02:09.885
Kip moaned. "Maybe tomorrow, Bird.

26
00:02:09.886 --> 00:02:17.022
I'm done playing in the snow today!"

